msgid "Identify, assess and treat the risks of the organisation: the register, the risks reported by staff, the heatmap, the catalogue of typical risks and the accepted risks."
msgstr "Identify, assess and treat the risks of the organisation: the register, the risks reported by staff, the heatmap, the catalogue of typical risks and the accepted risks."

msgid "Map and library"
msgstr "Map and library"

msgid "Import and export"
msgstr "Import and export"

msgid "Risk analyses"
msgstr "Risk analyses"

msgid "Go deeper into the risks: impact analyses, domino effects between risks, EBIOS Risk Manager studies and key risk indicators."
msgstr "Go deeper into the risks: impact analyses, domino effects between risks, EBIOS Risk Manager studies and key risk indicators."

msgid "Security controls (SoA)"
msgstr "Security controls (SoA)"

msgid "The security measures of Annex A and the Statement of Applicability: which measures apply, what blocks them and whether they work."
msgstr "The security measures of Annex A and the Statement of Applicability: which measures apply, what blocks them and whether they work."

msgid "Policies and procedures"
msgstr "Policies and procedures"

msgid "The written rules of the organisation: policies, ready-to-adapt templates, operating procedures and the online services approved for use."
msgstr "The written rules of the organisation: policies, ready-to-adapt templates, operating procedures and the online services approved for use."

msgid "Audits and evidence"
msgstr "Audits and evidence"

msgid "Prepare and follow the audits, and keep the evidence that the security measures are applied."
msgstr "Prepare and follow the audits, and keep the evidence that the security measures are applied."

msgid "Handle what does not work and follow the progress: nonconformities, open gaps, security objectives and management reviews."
msgstr "Handle what does not work and follow the progress: nonconformities, open gaps, security objectives and management reviews."

msgid "Regulations"
msgstr "Regulations"

msgid "The laws and standards that apply besides ISO 27001 (NIS2 and its national versions, DORA, other frameworks) and how far you comply with them."
msgstr "The laws and standards that apply besides ISO 27001 (NIS2 and its national versions, DORA, other frameworks) and how far you comply with them."

msgid "Privacy (GDPR)"
msgstr "Privacy (GDPR)"

msgid "Personal data: the record of processing activities, the requests from the people concerned and the data breaches."
msgstr "Personal data: the record of processing activities, the requests from the people concerned and the data breaches."

msgid "Access and accounts"
msgstr "Access and accounts"

msgid "Who has access to what: access reviews, periodic reviews, account hygiene, multi-factor authentication and file share permissions."
msgstr "Who has access to what: access reviews, periodic reviews, account hygiene, multi-factor authentication and file share permissions."

msgid "People and awareness"
msgstr "People and awareness"

msgid "The staff side of security: the compliance of each person, training, phishing simulations, skills and the accounts exposed in data leaks."
msgstr "The staff side of security: the compliance of each person, training, phishing simulations, skills and the accounts exposed in data leaks."

msgid "ISMS organisation"
msgstr "ISMS organisation"

msgid "How the management system is organised: the requirements of clauses 4 to 10, the context, the responsibilities, the decisions delegated during an absence, the official contacts and the obligations."
msgstr "How the management system is organised: the requirements of clauses 4 to 10, the context, the responsibilities, the decisions delegated during an absence, the official contacts and the obligations."

msgid "Start with what is overdue, then open the screen you need from the cards below."
msgstr "Start with what is overdue, then open the screen you need from the cards below."

msgid "What is waiting for you"
msgstr "What is waiting for you"

msgid "All my tasks"
msgstr "All my tasks"

